== selected options of the ast2600-evb machine (qemu-system-arm -machine ast2600-evb,help)
  bmc-console=<string>   - Change the default UART to "uartX"
  boot=<BootConfiguration> - Boot configuration
  execute-in-place=<bool> - boot directly from CE0 flash device
  firmware=<string>      - Firmware image
  fmc-model=<string>     - Change the FMC Flash model
  kernel=<string>        - Linux kernel image file
  spi-model=<string>     - Change the SPI Flash model

